OL,3,GNEWSAReform holds on to majority in    
OL,4,Aby-election win                        
OL,6,FTaylor said he was "blown away" by the 
OL,7,Fresult and the support he received,    
OL,8,Fwhile Labour believes a much closer    
OL,9,Fvote than the May 2025 election shows  
OL,10,Fthe party is regaining ground in the   
OL,11,Farea.                                  
